{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Blender Mesh Index Compatibility.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Blender Mesh Index Compatibility.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"blender mesh index compatibility blender mesh index compatibility","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Blender Mesh Index Compatibility.md","fileName":"Blender Mesh Index Compatibility.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Blender Mesh Index Compatibility","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-08 09:04\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[Procedural Mesh Editing with bmesh]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Procedural Mesh Editing with bmesh","blenderpythonapi.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Blender Mesh Index Compatibility.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Blender Mesh Index Compatibility.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"blender mesh index compatibility blender mesh index compatibility","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Blender Mesh Index Compatibility.md","fileName":"Blender Mesh Index Compatibility.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Blender Mesh Index Compatibility","heading":"Blender Mesh Index Compatibility","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"Hardcoded vertex, edge, and face indices may reproduce a result within one controlled Blender version and mesh history, but they are not dependable semantic identifiers. Version changes and topology operations can reorder components even when the visible model remains similar.\n\nShared or long-lived scripts should select geometry by characteristics such as position, bounds, connectivity, or orientation. Index-based access remains practical when the input and execution history are strictly controlled, but that constraint should be explicit. Lookup-table refreshes prevent stale access errors; they do not solve cross-version meaning.","tags":["baby"],"links":["Procedural Mesh Editing with bmesh","blenderpythonapi.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Blender Mesh Index Compatibility.md::2","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Blender Mesh Index Compatibility.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"blender mesh index compatibility blender mesh index compatibility","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Blender Mesh Index Compatibility.md","fileName":"Blender Mesh Index Compatibility.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Blender Mesh Index Compatibility","heading":"References","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"[[blenderpythonapi.pdf]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Procedural Mesh Editing with bmesh","blenderpythonapi.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""}]}